      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "For the most impactful return, I recommend prioritizing Zip Codes 90502, 90334, and 90801. These areas exhibit the lowest median incomes and highest crime rates, suggesting the greatest need for community support. Placing centers here could address significant social challenges and improve community well-being where resources are most scarce. This approach maximizes the potential for transformative change through targeted investment.",
